{"id":"e178b36b56d859a4","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheaf-extension-from-basis.md","title":"Theorem II.1 Extension from a Basis","display":"Theorem II.1 Extension from a Basis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheaf-extension-from-basis","aliases":["14-thm-sheaf-extension-from-basis"],"display":"Theorem II.1 Extension from a Basis","depends_on":["[[14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases]]","[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]"],"source_location":"II.1 Theorem 3, printed 69; II Exercise 4, printed 104; DjVu 40,58","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheaf-extension-from-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheaf-extension-from-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.1 Extension from a Basis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"05d7b908303b22f7\" href=\"?note=05d7b908303b22f7\" title=\"14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases\">14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.1 Theorem 3, printed 69; II Exercise 4, printed 104; DjVu 40,58"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeetBasis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeetBasis}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BasisSheaf}(P,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{BasisSheaf}(P,\\mathcal B)\\)</span>，基范畴采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"05d7b908303b22f7\" href=\"?note=05d7b908303b22f7\" title=\"14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases\">14-df-sheaves-on-intersection-stable-bases</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 的满子范畴。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,T\">\\(R,T\\)</span> 为基范畴上的预层。自然变换均为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 的带源靶三元组编码；基上的对应自然变换集合在下式直接以函子范畴 Hom 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 表示限制箭头的底层函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_U:=\\{B\\in\\mathcal B\\mid B\\subseteq U\\},\\qquad\\widetilde P(U):=\\left\\{(s_B)_{B\\in\\mathcal B_U}\\in\\prod_{B\\in\\mathcal B_U}P(B)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal B_U\\ (C\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow\\rho^B_{P,C}(s_B)=s_C)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_U:=\\{B\\in\\mathcal B\\mid B\\subseteq U\\},\\qquad\\widetilde P(U):=\\left\\{(s_B)_{B\\in\\mathcal B_U}\\in\\prod_{B\\in\\mathcal B_U}P(B)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal B_U\\ (C\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow\\rho^B_{P,C}(s_B)=s_C)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho^U_{\\widetilde P,V}((s_B)_{B\\in\\mathcal B_U}):=(s_B)_{B\\in\\mathcal B_V}\\quad(U,V\\in\\tau,\\ V\\subseteq U),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(\\widetilde P,X,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho^U_{\\widetilde P,V}((s_B)_{B\\in\\mathcal B_U}):=(s_B)_{B\\in\\mathcal B_V}\\quad(U,V\\in\\tau,\\ V\\subseteq U),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(\\widetilde P,X,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F|_{\\mathcal B}:=\\bigl(F_0|_{\\mathcal B},\\ F_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau))}\\bigr),\\qquad\\mathrm{Nat}_{\\mathcal B}(R,T):=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\operatorname{FunCat}(\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau),\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})}(R,T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F|_{\\mathcal B}:=\\bigl(F_0|_{\\mathcal B},\\ F_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau))}\\bigr),\\qquad\\mathrm{Nat}_{\\mathcal B}(R,T):=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\operatorname{FunCat}(\\mathrm{BasisCat}(\\mathcal B;X,\\tau),\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})}(R,T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\quad\\bigl(\\widetilde P(B),P(B),((s_C)_C\\mapsto s_B)\\bigr):\\widetilde P(B)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}P(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\quad\\bigl(\\widetilde P(B),P(B),((s_C)_C\\mapsto s_B)\\bigr):\\widetilde P(B)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}P(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}_{\\mathcal B}^{F,G}:\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,G)\\to\\mathrm{Nat}_{\\mathcal B}(F|_{\\mathcal B},G|_{\\mathcal B}),\\qquad\\mathrm{Res}_{\\mathcal B}^{F,G}(\\theta):=(F|_{\\mathcal B},G|_{\\mathcal B},(\\theta_B)_{B\\in\\mathcal B}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Res}_{\\mathcal B}^{F,G}:\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,G)\\to\\mathrm{Nat}_{\\mathcal B}(F|_{\\mathcal B},G|_{\\mathcal B}),\\qquad\\mathrm{Res}_{\\mathcal B}^{F,G}(\\theta):=(F|_{\\mathcal B},G|_{\\mathcal B},(\\theta_B)_{B\\in\\mathcal B}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall F,G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau))\\ \\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_{\\mathcal B}(F|_{\\mathcal B},G|_{\\mathcal B})\\ \\exists!\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,G)\\quad\\mathrm{Res}_{\\mathcal B}^{F,G}(\\theta)=\\eta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall F,G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau))\\ \\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_{\\mathcal B}(F|_{\\mathcal B},G|_{\\mathcal B})\\ \\exists!\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,G)\\quad\\mathrm{Res}_{\\mathcal B}^{F,G}(\\theta)=\\eta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：给定开覆盖上的兼容延拓元组，固定一个基开集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，再用覆盖与基细化覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；其局部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 值按基层条件唯一拼接。不同细化由共同交细化比较，得到独立于选择的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_B\">\\(s_B\\)</span>，并满足限制相容。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 本身在基中，其分量决定全部较小分量，给出所示双射。层态射由在基上的分量按相同拼接过程唯一延拓，故限制函子全忠实且本质满。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertio